 Dave! That shot looks great! Nature's so amazing!\" [S30T9][S30T10]. Dave added it's incredible how much emotion and beauty nature can convey through a photo, and agreed with Calvin that nature can boost the spirits in tough times [S30T11][S30T13]; he also shared a picture he snapped the previous week (~2023-11-10/16) — a peaceful scene of a waterfall flowing over rocks and boulders — taken at a serene spot in a nearby park (Calvin: \"Wow Dave, that picture is stunning! Where was that taken? It looks so serene!\"; the park details in ## Parks) [S30T13][S30T14][S30T15].","text_sha256":"730b6bea11506ea335f01319bb357552f0d1fa388b34be11670317460a856c10","timestamp":"2023-11-17T10:54:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":705,"filesystem_tool_calls":3,"model_calls":5,"orchestration_calls":2,"prompt_tokens":116023,"provider_request_attempts":5,"provider_rounds":5,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":116728},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"56a7ee328b702acf677218605c2d649afe0089eda09165e5aadb286969116965","filesystem_tools_sha256":"6d9d68f047917d20adb9133168d5726233c9719dbefd54627e08827832d963c6","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3506af86ae75acd7ce07f88bae7a25e1bfec56a5b1c9f44abd3d71a2e6f4eb2d","paper_prompt_id":"filesystem-appendix-a3-prompt-5-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"de03315ff999a8bcea7e08a10866f3a6dc74badf690d23a036e35c74ff81335c"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What type of photos does Dave like to capture with his new camera?","question_id":"conv-50-q154","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":23,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"ee1b09528838ec0b8f9fca